{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">憑處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》「大小姐」一角深入民心的林淑敏，螢幕上雖然霸氣十足，但私底下的她卻是出了名的溫柔兼人美心善！趁着中秋佳節，她特別抽空化身義工落區向長者送暖，一系列溫馨照片曝光後，獲大批網民激讚她充滿正能量。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656299812204856_49766579.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026DG1IIZFzFc1790319670.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656299812204856_49766579.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">從相片可見，穿上休閒服裝及義工圍裙的林淑敏，走入餐廳廚房，雙手捧着三大碟美食笑容滿面地為長者上菜，化身「最靚侍應」。此外，她亦與一眾義工落手落腳，精心準備了一盒盒色彩繽紛、賣相精緻的果凍月餅，並親自端上枱請老友記品嘗，絕對是出心又出力。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"820374001_18631594630038580_7729099677429323634_n.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GLrkxCFo8V1790319954.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"820374001_18631594630038580_7729099677429323634_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_aeb985c997e8879c-32\" style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">「大小姐」駕到，一班老友記當然非常驚喜。林淑敏全程表現得極度親民，毫無架子的她主動與多位長者頭貼頭玩自拍打卡，𠱁得在場的公公婆婆非常開心，氣氛樂也融融。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">大批粉絲睇到這輯照片後，都紛紛留言大讚：「大小姐真係好好人」、「戲外真係好溫柔」、「人美心善嘅典範」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656282347048345_49766579.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wK0A1H7nkG1790319670.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656282347048345_49766579.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656308511241463_49766579.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20262IDdAa8cb91790319669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sukman_lam_1790301108_3993656308511241463_49766579.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T07:38:37.233927+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}